msgid "Confirmed deleted (gone from the KMS)"
msgstr "حذف تأییدشده (از KMS ناپدید شده)"

#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:349
msgid ""
"Out of sync — still on the provider, should be gone. Their deletion date has "
"passed, so a provider deletion was canceled in the KMS, or failed. "
"Investigate on the provider:"
msgstr ""
"ناهماهنگ — هنوز نزد ارائه‌دهنده است، در حالی که باید رفته باشد. تاریخ حذفشان "
"گذشته است، پس حذف در KMS لغو شده یا شکست خورده است. نزد ارائه‌دهنده بررسی "
"کنید:"

#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:359
msgid ""
"Out of sync — gone from the provider, no record of why. An active or "
"scheduled key vanished from the listing (deleted in the KMS). Record the "
"deletion on the Key Encryption Keys page to close it:"
msgstr ""
